  "title": "Zucchini Chocolate Chip Muffins",
  "description": "These easy zucchini chocolate chip muffins are moist, fluffy, and studded with mini chocolate chips and walnuts for a tasty breakfast or snack.",
  "authors": [
    "Eva Howard"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:49:40-04:00",
